OL,3,GNEWSATom Grennan returns to Bedford
OL,4,Avenue for free shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger-songwriter Tom Grennan has
OL,7,Forganised two free gigs at the music
OL,8,Fvenue where he began performing as a
OL,9,Fteenager.
OL,11,FThe Bedford-born musician is playing
OL,12,Fthree venues over three days on his
OL,13,FLooking Back Live tour, featuring what
OL,14,Fpromoters described as "intimate
OL,15,Facoustic sets in the rooms that helped
OL,16,Fshape his journey".
OL,18,FTickets for the Little Bit Of Love
OL,19,Fsinger's two shows at Bedford Esquires
OL,20,Fhave already been allocated through an
OL,21,Fonline lottery.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
