OL,3,GNEWSATom Grennan returns to Bedford
OL,4,Avenue for free shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenue owner Gareth Barber said: "We
OL,7,Fwatched him grow as a young teen in
OL,8,Flocal bands to the genuine star he has
OL,9,Fbecome and I'm really proud of how far
OL,10,Fhe has gone."
